DATA ATTRIBUTION

Document metadata, titles, quotations and source URLs in fixtures/ and web/data/
are derived from the GDELT Project (https://www.gdeltproject.org/), used under
its terms, which require attribution. GDELT is not affiliated with this project
and does not endorse it.

Coffee "C" certified warehouse stock figures are derived from public reports
published by ICE Futures U.S. (https://www.ice.com/). Positioning data, where
used, is from the U.S. Commodity Futures Trading Commission. Price series are
retrieved from public endpoints for research illustration only and are not
official exchange settlements.

This repository is a research prototype. Nothing in it is investment advice, and
no signal it produces has demonstrated predictive value -- see docs/CASE_STUDY.md.
